WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
An experience can feel convincing before we know its cause.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers compared hypnosis with ordinary imaginative suggestions.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But this was not a test of a commercial meditation recording.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Ask who was tested, against which alternative.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine before paying.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the record. Check the offer. Then decide.
